      {
        "id": "dir-returns-names",
        "moduleId": "name-list-definition",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材定义：dir() 列出对象定义的名称",
        "markdown": "内置的 `dir()` 函数返回由对象所定义的名称列表。若对象是一个模块，该列表会包含模块内定义的函数、类和变量。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
